## Python Instruction
Write a python function to find the largest number that can be formed from the digits of a given number.

## Python Solution
```python
def find_LargestNum(n):
    strNum = str(n)
    listNum = list(strNum)

    # sort the list in reverse order
    listNum.sort(reverse=True)

    # join the list into a string and convert it to an integer
    largestNum = int(''.join(listNum))

    return largestNum
```

## Python Tests
assert find_LargestNum(13245) == 54321
assert find_LargestNum(12345) == 54321
assert find_LargestNum(32145) == 54321

